  "description": "A decade of 22” innovation, perfected.\n\nCelebrating 10 years of 22” BMX development, the new DK Vega SS represents the pinnacle of larger-wheel performance. It is a refined, pro-level machine engineered to be light enough for the racetrack while remaining tough enough to handle heavy park and trail sessions.\n\nBuilt around a 100% chromoly frame featuring custom-butted and tapered tubing, the Vega SS strikes the ultimate balance of strength and weight savings. Outfitted with a premium lineup of proven DK aftermarket components, including the DK Phase fork, DK Phase bars, DK Social cranks, and a DK Chamberlain stem. The Vega SS delivers the stability and comfort of a 22” setup with the lightweight, responsive feel of a custom build.",
